### Tags API Tests


### Base URL

@host = http://localhost:8080/api


### 


### IMPORTANT: Run auth.http login test first to set the userAuth token


### 


### Create a New Tag

# @name createTag

POST {{host}}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "description": "Articles about Spring Boot framework and its features",
  "name": "Spring Boot"
}


### 


### Create Another Tag

# @name createJavaTag

POST {{host}}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "description": "Java programming language articles and tutorials",
  "name": "Java"
}


### 


### Create Tag - MongoDB

# @name createMongoTag

POST {{host}}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "description": "NoSQL database articles and MongoDB tutorials",
  "name": "MongoDB"
}


### 


### Create Tag - Docker

# @name createDockerTag

POST {{host}}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "description": "Containerization and Docker guides",
  "name": "Docker"
}


### 


### Create Tag - REST API

# @name createRestApiTag

POST {{host}}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "description": "RESTful API design and development",
  "name": "REST API"
}


### 


### Get All Tags (with pagination)

# @name getAllTags

GET {{host}}/tags?page=0&size=10&sort=name,asc HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get All Tags - Page 2

# @name getAllTagsPage2

GET {{host}}/tags?page=1&size=5 HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get a Tag by ID

# @name getTag

GET {{host}}/tags/{{tagId}} HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get a Tag by Slug

# @name getTagBySlug

GET {{host}}/tags/slug/spring-boot HTTP/1.1


### 


### Search Tags by Keyword

# @name searchTags

GET {{host}}/tags/search?keyword=spring HTTP/1.1


### 


### Search Tags - Java

# @name searchTagsJava

GET {{host}}/tags/search?keyword=java HTTP/1.1


### 


### Search Tags - API

# @name searchTagsApi

GET {{host}}/tags/search?keyword=api HTTP/1.1


### 


### Update a Tag

# @name updateTag

PUT {{host}}/tags/{{tagId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "description": "Updated: Articles about Spring Boot 3.x framework, features, and best practices",
  "name": "Spring Boot 3"
}


### 


### Delete a Tag

# @name deleteTag

DELETE {{host}}/tags/{{tagId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{userAuth}}


### 


### Test Create Tag with Empty Name (validation error)

# @name createInvalidTag

POST {{host}}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "description": "This should fail",
  "name": ""
}


### 


### Test Create Tag with Missing Description

# @name createTagNoDescription

POST {{host}}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "name": "Test Tag"
}


### 


### Test Create Duplicate Tag (same name)

# @name createDuplicateTag

POST {{host}}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

{
  "description": "This should fail if Spring Boot tag already exists",
  "name": "Spring Boot"
}


### 


### Test Create Tag without Authentication (should return 401)

# @name createTagUnauthorized

POST {{host}}/tags HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This should fail - no auth token",
  "name": "Unauthorized Tag"
}


### 


### Test Update Tag without Authentication (should return 401)

# @name updateTagUnauthorized

PUT {{host}}/tags/{{tagId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This should fail",
  "name": "Unauthorized Update"
}


### 


### Test Delete Tag without Authentication (should return 401)

# @name deleteTagUnauthorized

DELETE {{host}}/tags/{{tagId}} HTTP/1.1


### 


### Test Get Non-existent Tag by ID (should return 404)

# @name getNonExistentTag

GET {{host}}/tags/99999 HTTP/1.1


### 


### Test Get Non-existent Tag by Slug (should return 404)

# @name getNonExistentTagBySlug

GET {{host}}/tags/slug/non-existent-slug HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get All Tags with Different Sorting Options

# @name getAllTagsSortByNameDesc

GET {{host}}/tags?page=0&size=10&sort=name,desc HTTP/1.1


### 


### Get All Tags Sorted by Created Date

# @name getAllTagsSortByDate

GET {{host}}/tags?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc HTTP/1.1


